<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>系统总体架构</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 4.1 节 · 三层部署、五层逻辑</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:250, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:50, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>表现层</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Vue 3 页面、Router、Axios、ECharts、Capacitor　|　Android APK</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:50, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>接口层</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Spring Security、JWT 过滤器、Controller　|　认证、鉴权、参数校验、统一响应</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:50, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>业务层</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Service、领域规则、统计、AI 摘要与降级　|　事务与换算口径</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:50, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>数据层</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>JPA / Repository、MySQL 8.4（演示 H2）　|　12 张业务表</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:50, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 150 }}>模型层</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>本地 Ollama / Qwen3-4B　|　只接收摘要 JSON，不直连数据库</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:194, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>外部接口与约束</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>手机端 ↔ 服务端：HTTPS + JSON，Bearer 令牌；业务错误仍返回 HTTP 200<br />服务端 ↔ MySQL：JDBC，JPA 事务，DATETIME 按 Asia/Shanghai<br />服务端 ↔ Ollama：连接 3 s、读取 60 s，失败降级</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>架构结论</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>手机端只负责交互与展示，不可直连数据库与模型<br />身份、规则、统计与 AI 请求统一收敛在业务服务<br />私有数据一律按 user_id 归属，服务端忽略客户端传入的身份</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>所有口径与隐私边界收敛在服务端，手机端与数据库、模型之间保持单向依赖。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
